    "type": "python",
    "question": "Write `solve(data)` where `data` is `[nums, target]`. Return the number of UNORDERED index pairs (i, j) with i < j such that nums[i] + nums[j] == target. Duplicate values are allowed and each pair of indices is counted once. Do this in a single O(N) pass.",
