    "question": "Write `solve(data)` where `data` is a list of [start, end] intervals (integers, possibly unsorted). Merge all overlapping or touching intervals and return the merged list sorted by start. Intervals that only touch at an endpoint (e.g. [1,3] and [3,5]) should be merged into one.",
