    "question": "You are given a dict `data` mapping each user (str) to a list of role names (list of str). Write `solve(data)` that inverts it into a dict mapping each role to a sorted list of the users who have that role. The output keys (roles) should be iterated in sorted order, and each user list sorted ascending.",
