    "solutionCode": "-- Cumulative SUM windowed per account, ordered by transaction id\nSELECT account_id, txn_id, amount,\n  SUM(amount) OVER (\n    PARTITION BY account_id\n    ORDER BY txn_id\n    -- Sum all rows from the start of the partition through the current row\n    ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW\n  ) AS balance\nFROM transactions\n-- Deterministic ordering\nORDER BY account_id, txn_id;",
