    "initialCode": "-- Write your SQL query here\nSELECT * FROM users;",
    "solutionCode": "-- Join users to their activity rows for the target month only\nSELECT u.signup_month,\n  -- Distinct guards against multiple activity rows per user\n  COUNT(DISTINCT a.user_id) AS active_users\nFROM users u\nJOIN activity a\n  ON u.user_id = a.user_id\n  -- Restrict to the analysis month\n  AND a.active_month = '2026-03'\nGROUP BY u.signup_month\n-- Deterministic ordering by cohort\nORDER BY u.signup_month;",
