    "solutionCode": "-- For each target step, count users who reached that step or beyond\nWITH steps(step) AS (\n    SELECT 1 UNION ALL SELECT 2 UNION ALL SELECT 3   -- the three funnel stages\n)\nSELECT s.step,\n       COUNT(DISTINCT f.user_id) AS users            -- distinct users at-or-past this step\nFROM steps s\nLEFT JOIN funnel_events f ON f.step >= s.step         -- reached at least this step\nGROUP BY s.step\nORDER BY s.step;                                       -- deterministic ordering",
